{"seq":3,"slug":"keyframes-latency","title":"关键帧与延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode/keyframes-latency","wordCount":1562,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"关键帧与延迟\">关键帧与延迟</h1><p>关键帧是视频编码里一个支点般的概念：它同时拉动三根杠杆——容错能力、可 seek 性、和体积——而你对它的间隔设置又直接决定了端到端延迟能压到多低。<a href=\"encoding-parameters\">编码参数与码率控制</a> 处理的是「每帧花多少比特」，这一篇处理的是「时间维度的结构」：关键帧多久来一次、怎么手动强制、<code>latencyMode: realtime</code> 到底改变了什么、以及如何为一条直播或云游戏链路算出一份可信的延迟预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关键帧（I 帧）是自包含的，差分帧（P/B 帧）只存与参考帧的差异——这一个事实同时拉动三根杠杆：<strong>容错</strong>（间隔越短，丢包/错误后恢复越快）、<strong>可 seek 性</strong>（间隔越短，seek 时「快进解码」的距离越短）、<strong>体积</strong>（关键帧比差分帧大一个数量级，越密码率越高）。GOP 间隔就是在这三者之间的取舍。</p>\n<p>在这之上，<code>latencyMode</code> 是延迟的总开关：<code>quality</code>（默认）做前瞻缓冲并可能用 B 帧，换来更高压缩率但每帧延迟数拍；<code>realtime</code> 关掉前瞻与 B 帧，帧即编即出，代价是压缩率略低。禁用 B 帧还有一个连带好处——解码顺序等于显示顺序，下游不再需要重排序缓冲。<strong>端到端延迟是各段之和</strong>，因此优化重心不在编解码本身，而在消灭每一处不必要的排队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键帧到底买来了什么\">关键帧到底买来了什么</h2><p>关键帧（I 帧）是自包含的：不依赖任何其它帧就能独立解码。差分帧（P/B 帧）只存与参考帧的差异，体积小得多，但必须沿着参考链一路解过来。一段视频里关键帧的间隔（GOP, Group of Pictures 长度）决定了三件事的取舍：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[关键帧间隔 GOP] --&gt; B[间隔短 关键帧密]&#10;  A --&gt; C[间隔长 关键帧稀]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[容错强 丢一帧很快恢复]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[seek 快 起点近]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[体积大 I帧昂贵且频繁]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[体积小 压缩率高]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[seek 慢 要快进解码]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[容错弱 错误传播久]\">flowchart TD\n  A[关键帧间隔 GOP] --&gt; B[间隔短 关键帧密]\n  A --&gt; C[间隔长 关键帧稀]\n  B --&gt; B1[容错强 丢一帧很快恢复]\n  B --&gt; B2[seek 快 起点近]\n  B --&gt; B3[体积大 I帧昂贵且频繁]\n  C --&gt; C1[体积小 压缩率高]\n  C --&gt; C2[seek 慢 要快进解码]\n  C --&gt; C3[容错弱 错误传播久]</pre><p>关键帧比差分帧大一个数量级（它不能借助前帧压缩），所以<strong>关键帧越密、码率越高</strong>。但密的关键帧换来两个好处：丢包/错误后能更快在下个关键帧处恢复（容错），以及 seek 时离最近关键帧更近、要「快进解码」的距离更短（<a href=\"../decode/decode-pipeline\">解码流水线与时序</a> 讲过 seek 必须从关键帧起步）。这就是核心权衡：<strong>容错+可 seek vs 体积</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GOP 间隔</th>\n<th>体积</th>\n<th>seek 体验</th>\n<th>容错</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极短（~0.5s，每 15–30 帧）</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>实时、低延迟流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中（1–2s）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>流畅</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>直播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长（5–10s）</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>偶有定位延迟</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>点播/存档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"手动强制关键帧\">手动强制关键帧</h2><p>WebCodecs 把关键帧节奏的主动权交给你。<code>encode()</code> 的第二参数可指定 <code>{ keyFrame: true }</code>，强制当前帧编成关键帧：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const KEYFRAME_INTERVAL = 60; // 每 60 帧一个关键帧（30fps 即每 2 秒）&#10;let frameCount = 0;&#10;&#10;function encodeFrame(frame) {&#10;  const keyFrame = frameCount % KEYFRAME_INTERVAL === 0;&#10;  encoder.encode(frame, { keyFrame }); // 首帧 count=0 自然成 key&#10;  frame.close();&#10;  frameCount++;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const KEYFRAME_INTERVAL = 60; // 每 60 帧一个关键帧（30fps 即每 2 秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let frameCount = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function encodeFrame(frame) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const keyFrame = frameCount % KEYFRAME_INTERVAL === 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  encoder.encode(frame, { keyFrame }); // 首帧 count=0 自然成 key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  frame.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  frameCount++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>除了固定间隔，还有两种常见的「事件驱动」强制关键帧的时机：一是接收端反馈丢包/解码失败时，发送端立即插入关键帧帮它恢复（实时场景）；二是场景切换（画面剧变）时插关键帧，因为此时差分帧本来就省不了多少、不如直接来个干净起点。注意：编码器的第一帧总是关键帧，无需你显式指定（<a href=\"video-encoder\">VideoEncoder</a>）。某些编码器配置也支持自动按间隔插关键帧，但显式控制最可移植。</p>\n<h2 id=\"latencymode-realtime-改变了什么\">latencyMode：realtime 改变了什么</h2><p><code>latencyMode</code> 是延迟的总开关。默认 <code>quality</code> 让编码器为了压缩率做前瞻（lookahead）：它会缓冲若干未来帧来更聪明地分配比特、并可能用 B 帧（双向预测）。前瞻和 B 帧都意味着「一帧进去后要等几帧才出来」，这对离线导出无所谓，对实时却是致命延迟。</p>\n<p><code>latencyMode: &quot;realtime&quot;</code> 翻转这个权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>quality</code>（默认）</th>\n<th><code>realtime</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前瞻缓冲</td>\n<td>有（攒未来帧）</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 帧</td>\n<td>可能使用</td>\n<td>通常禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧延迟</td>\n<td>一帧进、数帧后出</td>\n<td>一帧进、立即出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩率</td>\n<td>更高</td>\n<td>略低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>码率平稳性</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>配合 CBR 更稳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>禁用 B 帧还有一个连带好处：解码顺序等于显示顺序，下游不需要重排序缓冲（<a href=\"../decode/decode-pipeline\">解码流水线与时序</a> 里的 PTS/DTS 乱序问题消失），presentation queue 可以做到极浅。所以低延迟链路的标准配方是 <code>latencyMode:&#39;realtime&#39;</code> + <code>bitrateMode:&#39;constant&#39;</code> + 短 GOP + 禁 B 帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算一份端到端延迟预算\">算一份端到端延迟预算</h2><p>「延迟低」不是感觉，是能加出来的数字。一条 采集→编码→传输→解码→显示 的链路，端到端延迟是各段之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{e2e} = T_{capture} + T_{encode} + T_{queue} + T_{network} + T_{decode} + T_{buffer} + T_{render}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>WebCodecs 能直接压低的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{encode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（用 realtime + 硬件）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（控制 <code>encodeQueueSize</code>/<code>decodeQueueSize</code> 不堆积）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{buffer}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（presentation 缓冲做到 1–2 帧）。一个云游戏目标的粗略预算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>典型耗时（低延迟优化后）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采集（一帧间隔）</td>\n<td>~16 ms（60fps）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码（realtime+硬件）</td>\n<td>2–8 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发送队列</td>\n<td>&lt;5 ms（背压控制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络（同区域）</td>\n<td>10–40 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解码</td>\n<td>2–8 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显示缓冲</td>\n<td>~16 ms（1 帧）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~50–90 ms</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要点：编码/解码本身在硬件 + realtime 下只占个位数毫秒，真正吃掉延迟的是网络和任何「攒缓冲」的环节。所以低延迟工程的重心是消灭每一处不必要的排队——这也是为什么 <code>encodeQueueSize</code> 背压(见 <a href=\"video-encoder\">VideoEncoder</a>)和浅 presentation 队列如此关键。网络段的优化（拥塞控制、丢包恢复）超出本 hub，属于 <a href=\"../../frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/quality-congestion\">WebRTC 媒体 · 质量与拥塞</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>关键帧（I 帧）自包含，差分帧靠参考链；GOP 间隔在「容错+可 seek」与「体积」之间取舍——关键帧越密码率越高但恢复/定位越快。</li>\n<li>用 <code>encode(frame, { keyFrame: true })</code> 手动强制；常见时机是固定间隔、收到丢包反馈、场景切换；首帧自动成关键帧。</li>\n<li><code>latencyMode:&#39;realtime&#39;</code> 关掉前瞻与 B 帧，帧即编即出，且因解码顺序=显示顺序而免去重排序缓冲，代价是略低压缩率。</li>\n<li>低延迟标准配方：realtime + CBR + 短 GOP + 禁 B 帧 + 浅缓冲。</li>\n<li>端到端延迟是各段之和；编解码在硬件+realtime 下仅个位数毫秒，瓶颈在网络与任何排队，工程重心是消灭不必要的队列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>关键帧约束的解码侧后果：<a href=\"../decode/decode-pipeline\">解码流水线与时序</a>（seek 与 PTS/DTS 重排）。</li>\n<li>强制关键帧的 API 出处：<a href=\"video-encoder\">VideoEncoder</a>；模式取舍：<a href=\"encoding-parameters\">编码参数与码率控制</a>。</li>\n<li>把延迟预算继续压到极致的整体手段：<a href=\"../practice/webcodecs-performance\">性能与零拷贝</a>。</li>\n<li>网络段的延迟与丢包：<a href=\"../../frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/quality-congestion\">WebRTC 媒体 · 质量与拥塞</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关键帧与延迟","id":"关键帧与延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"关键帧到底买来了什么","id":"关键帧到底买来了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"手动强制关键帧","id":"手动强制关键帧"},{"level":2,"text":"latencyMode：realtime 改变了什么","id":"latencymode-realtime-改变了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"算一份端到端延迟预算","id":"算一份端到端延迟预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"编码参数与码率控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode/encoding-parameters"},"next":{"title":"与 Canvas/WebGL 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/practice/integration-canvas-webgl"}}